        "created_at": "2022-09-08T15:04:50.984Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got it on my second try, with help from an easier than average environment deck. Tempest pulled off Vicious Cyclone and Gene Bound Shackles, which made for some big spikes in damage. I did get lucky with Flechettes and Singularity both whiffing on turn 1 so my board state never got cleared.</p>",
