        "id": 248051,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-09-10T19:26:58.289Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Didn’t realize this was a random start; too bad, because my setup was amazing.  Easy mint in part due to two Ground Pounds, each one buying us an extra round to kill an EPE, and two Into the Stratospheres basically skipping his turn by recycling a Component.  This version of Tempest is normally not great, but he quickly found Localized Hurricane and used that to dig up the Shackles, which frequently applied twice on his turn thanks to plentiful attack One-Shots.  Fanatic took all the damage for round 2 and had to Aegis; later Haka went down to 2 because of an Enduring Intercession played by the Font of Power, but by then it was over.  COT never did Terraforming or Singularity, and the only Flechettes were on round 1, so we never lost any progress, and just gradually rolled over everything without breaking a sweat.  Only Bunker had a relatively poor setup and didn’t contribute too much to the win.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d\" title=\"Screenshot_20220910-121434\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220910-121434\" data-base62-sha1=\"iXC0w1uu066hH5TQCTrZKqbc9c1\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/84e43b15a448ec5fb5425647e10a96f24316cd1d_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220910-121434</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 102 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
