        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-09-11T16:37:36.265Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Had to settle for Fine on third try, with Haka and Fanatic at 4 and the other two down. Leaking Room and EMP Explosive is basically a death sentence.</p>\n<p>I think I hate Omnitron even a little more than Citizen Dawn when it comes to wiping the board. It’s got four cards vs. just two that can ruin your setup AND deal damage. This team really had no way to stack the deck and avoid them, either.</p>",
