        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431\" title=\"Screenshot_20220910-145551\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220910-145551\" data-base62-sha1=\"38uhX0oBAX8ilXOZPHeGOgLQrwR\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/15fc2a6fb6b0bad23f6f2cc308863461ba975431_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220910-145551</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 180 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nTook me three tries to come out on top here (n.b. Pillars of Hercules is freaking DANGEROUS in combination with Cosmic Omnitron); Tempest’s Cleansing Downpour just barely kept everyone on their front side toward the end while everyone beat on the big toaster, until Haka finished the job with an Elbow Smash.</p>",
